<header>
    <div class="tagline">Resilient Systems for an Unpredictable World</div>
    <h1>NeverDie System</h1>
    <p>The NeverDie System is a resilience-focused technology platform designed to help communities, facilities, and critical operations remain functional during disruption.</p>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>The Problem</h2>
    <p>Across the Great Lakes region, infrastructure systems are aging faster than they are being replaced. Environmental stress, climate volatility, and resource constraints increasingly threaten continuity.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Aging infrastructure and deferred maintenance</li>
        <li>Increasing climate and environmental disruption</li>
        <li>Static, fragmented emergency planning</li>
        <li>Systems that fail under real-world stress</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>The Solution</h2>
    <p>The NeverDie System prioritizes continuity over reaction. It is designed to support operations before, during, and after disruption.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Modular, adaptable system design</li>
        <li>Integration with existing infrastructure</li>
        <li>Decentralized and fault-tolerant principles</li>
        <li>Deployable, real-world focused solutions</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Who It’s For</h2>
    <p>NeverDie is being developed for organizations responsible for critical systems and public reliability.</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Municipalities and regional authorities</li>
        <li>Infrastructure and facility operators</li>
        <li>Utility-adjacent organizations</li>
        <li>Public-sector and resilience partners</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Current Status</h2>
    <p>NeverDie System is currently in early validation and system design, focused on customer discovery and preparing for pilot deployments. The company is pre-revenue and pre-seed.</p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Why the Great Lakes</h2>
    <p>The Great Lakes region is a critical convergence point for water, energy, infrastructure, and climate systems. NeverDie is being built with regional realities in mind, supporting long-term stability and resilience.</p>
</section>

